* bench_cell_thevenin: a cell as an EMF VCELL in series with a fixed internal resistance RINT.
* Ports p n (p is the positive terminal). Approximate: no state-of-charge, temperature, rate or polarisation effects.
.subckt bench_cell_thevenin p n params: VCELL=3 RINT=0.1
VEMF x n DC {VCELL}
RIN p x {RINT}
.ends bench_cell_thevenin
